<title>HONG KONG: Giordano Int'l 1996 net rises 4.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Giordano Int'l 1996 net rises 4.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   36.9     vs  38.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    11.5     vs  9.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    261.23   vs  250.23</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,522.05 vs  3,481.97</p>
<p>    Company name		 Giordano International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 24-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 10</p>
<p>NOTE - Giordano International is a casual apparel retailer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 16 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 4.5 cents) vs 13.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
